{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game operates on the premise of <strong>moving two heavy craniums</strong> that <strong>can only jump</strong> and are <strong>linked by a rope</strong>. With this limitation, you must learn to move in all directions, climb <strong>a surreal set of obstacles</strong> (like in life?), and <strong>perhaps also learn something about yourself</strong>. Additionally, you can listen to different experiences and viewpoints from around the world about <strong>frustration, sanity, perseverance, and effort.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Only two buttons to move.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging physics-based gameplay</strong> (Newton would probably find it easy).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The great company of those two</strong> even though they don't get along too well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 - \u221e hours of gameplay depending on your skill level.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fierce effort of self-discovery.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538140?t=1743964886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538140?t=1743964886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538140/59656ddb03699b17f58c54c25b413f4260796593/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743964886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538140/59656ddb03699b17f58c54c25b413f4260796593/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743964886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions